{"id":23565,"author":"Arigenn","body":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#2c2d30\" size=\"3\" style=\"background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003eWhat is your username in Minecraft and what is your favourite game on Avicus?\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; float: left; display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 0px; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e​\u003cspan style=\"font: 15px/22px Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003eMy Username is ZeroCookie_ or my rather well known older Username zero9178. My favourite game is Nebula and favourite gamemode CTW and TDM.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); text-transform: none; line-height: 22px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"\u003e​\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); text-transform: none; line-height: 22px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 0px; color: transparent; font-size: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; float: left; display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 0px; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003eIntroduce yourself in 3-4 sentences.\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 0px; color: transparent; font-size: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; float: left; display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 0px; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e​\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font: 15px/22px Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003eHiiiiiiiiiii. My name is Zero and I have been Staff for about 4-5 Months. I used to be very active as Defender in Apollo, but I am rather inactive at the moment, but you might still see me play scrims from time to time. Things I like a lot are Redstone, PVP, singing and technology (Praise our Lord and Saviour Elon Musk).\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); text-transform: none; line-height: 22px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"\u003e​\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 0px; color: transparent; font-size: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; float: left; display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 0px; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003eWhat are you the most excited/obsessed over at the moment?\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 0px; color: transparent; font-size: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; float: left; display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 0px; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e​\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font: 15px/22px Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003eRecently I have been playing tons of Nebula and Minecraft in general. I have also started doing a more redstone lately and I am even about to finish one building. A lot has also been going on in the technology world with Tesla opening the Gigafactory and SpaceX launching rockets as usual. I am also very obsessed with my girlfriend ;3 \u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); text-transform: none; line-height: 22px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"\u003e​\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 0px; color: transparent; font-size: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; float: left; display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 0px; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003eWhat interests you the most in life?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 0px; color: transparent; font-size: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; float: left; display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 0px; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e​\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font: 15px/22px Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"\u003eTesla, SpaceX, Computers, Computer Science, Smartphones.... all that stuff\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); text-transform: none; line-height: 22px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"\u003e​\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 0px; color: transparent; font-size: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; float: left; display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 0px; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003eWhat music/art/media do you like?\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 0px; color: transparent; font-size: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; float: left; display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 0px; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e​\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font: 15px/22px Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003eI listen to a lot of EDM, mostly Monstercat, where I like most stuff. Media I mostly watch technology or Science related videos on youtube.\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); text-transform: none; line-height: 22px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"\u003e​\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 0px; color: transparent; font-size: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; float: left; display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 0px; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003eWhere are you from?\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 0px; color: transparent; font-size: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; float: left; display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 0px; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e​\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font: 15px/22px Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003eI am from Austria! Not giving out more details. We are a small country (NOT AUSTRALIA. RE-READ)\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); text-transform: none; line-height: 22px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"\u003e​\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 0px; color: transparent; font-size: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; float: left; display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 0px; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003eWhat are the most common questions you get asked while moderating?\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 0px; color: transparent; font-size: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; float: left; display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 0px; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e​\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font: 15px/22px Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\"What are crates\" \"Can my friend get unbanned\" \"How do I get mod\"\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); text-transform: none; line-height: 22px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"\u003e​\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 0px; color: transparent; font-size: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; float: left; display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 0px; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003eDo you have a favourite staff member / community member?\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 0px; color: transparent; font-size: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; float: left; display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 0px; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e​\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font: 15px/22px Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003eI like my Apollo lads and of course my girlfriend. Don't know alot of people I don't like.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); text-transform: none; line-height: 22px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"\u003e​\u003